# ============================================================
# OpenAI products
# ============================================================

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sora.com

# ============================================================
# Notes
# ============================================================
#
# Already covered by DOMAIN-SUFFIX,openai.com:
#
#   *.auth.openai.com
#   auth0.openai.com
#   setup.auth.openai.com
#   chat.openai.com
#   desktop.chat.openai.com
#   ios.chat.openai.com
#   android.chat.openai.com
#   tcr9i.chat.openai.com
#
# Already covered by DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chatgpt.com:
#
#   ws.chatgpt.com
#   ab.chatgpt.com
#   codex-cloud-backend.chatgpt.com
#   ChatGPT / Codex websocket endpoints
#
# Do NOT hard-code the IP addresses seen for
# codex-cloud-backend.chatgpt.com.
# They carried valid TLS SNI and may change.
#
# ChatGPT Voice dynamic server IP ranges are intentionally
# not hard-coded.
